1. deleted with no context current, the same context current again on the same thread: 0 of 3 textures left
2. another context current in between: 3 of 3 of its own textures left, 3 of 3 in the first context (the deletes dropped, as Android drops them)
3. the context destroyed in between: a later context keeps 3 of 3 textures
4. eglReleaseThread in between: 3 of 3 textures left (the deletes dropped, as Android drops them)
5. 262144 names waiting, then more: 3 of 3 textures left (the deletes past the cap dropped)
6. eglTerminate with 3 names waiting: terminated (libEGL's line counts the names dropped)
gles deferred delete: applied only for the same context on the same thread
